        "https://www.tiktok.com/tag/modobarbie?refer=embed"
      ],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-793469-b00019",
      "text": "> ♬ sonido original – Picando Arepas",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 19,
      "body_start": 3167,
      "body_end": 3203,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.tiktok.com/music/sonido-original-7257966349682084614?refer=embed"
      ],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-793469-b00020",
      "text": "> We get in the #Barbiemood so you can come and eat your favorite arepa with pink dough. The dough is made of beet with flaxseed, a delicious and healthy combination, are you up for it?",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 20,
      "body_start": 3205,
      "body_end": 3390,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-793469-b00021",
      "text": "Barbie on planes",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 21,
      "body_start": 3392,
      "body_end": 3408,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "h3",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-793469-b00022",
      "text": "Larger corporations have also sought to benefit from Barbie's popularity. Mexican low-cost airline Volaris has painted Margot Robbie as ‘Barbie’ on one of their planes. Their marketing on Tiktok is also promoting ‘women as Barbie pilots‘.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 22,
      "body_start": 3410,
      "body_end": 3648,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.tiktok.com/@viajavolaris/video/7253211785975581957?embed_source=121355059%2C121351166%2C121331973%2C120811592%2C120810756%3Bnull%3Bembed_name&refer=embed&referer_url=globalvoices.org%2Fwp-admin%2Fpost.php%3Fpost%3D793469%26action%3Dedit&referer_video_id=7253211785975581957"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-793469-b00023",
