      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-793469-b00033",
      "text": "> Dictator Barbie in Lima's demonstrations",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 33,
      "body_start": 4629,
      "body_end": 4671,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-793469-b00034",
      "text": "In Mexico, too, there is an activist Barbie. According to Amnesty International's records, there are more than 110,000 missing persons, most of whom are victims of drug cartels or kidnapping gangs. In light of the poor efficacy of state-sponsored searches, it is mainly volunteer groups of women who search for disappeared loved ones among the Mexican plains, looking for clandestine graves. One of them, Delia Quiroa, created “Barbie Buscadora” (“Barbie Searcher”) when the film came out.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 34,
      "body_start": 4673,
      "body_end": 5162,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.nodal.am/2023/05/mexico-madres-de-desaparecidos-exigen-investigacion-y-busqueda-de-mas-de-110-mil-personas/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-793469-b00035",
      "text": "Quiroa told journalists:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 35,
      "body_start": 5164,
      "body_end": 5188,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-793469-b00036",
      "text": "> Barbie es todo lo que una persona quiere ser, pero ésta es una Barbie que no quiere ser. (…) Ella es lo que nadie quiere. Nadie quiere ser un buscador, nadie quiere estar buscando a un familiar.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 36,
      "body_start": 5190,
      "body_end": 5386,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-793469-b00037",
      "text": "> Barbie is everything a person wants to be, but this is a Barbie that doesn't want to exist. (…) She is what nobody wants to be. Nobody wants to be a searcher, nobody wants to be looking for a relative.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 37,
      "body_start": 5388,
      "body_end": 5591,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-793469-b00038",
      "text": "Barbie in humor",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 38,
      "body_start": 5593,
      "body_end": 5608,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "h3",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-793469-b00039",
      "text": "Other people have sought to make fun of living conditions in poorer areas in Latin America through Barbie. Among the countless parodies on Tiktok, this one has been one of the most popular, titled, “If they would have filmed ‘Barbie’ in my neighborhood.” It showcases the crowded minibuses, issues with buying cooking gas, flooding, and insecurity. The music is Aqua's Barbie Girl song remixed with cumbia rhythms.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 39,
      "body_start": 5610,
      "body_end": 6024,
      "source_links": [
        "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cumbia"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-793469-b00040",
      "text": "> @",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 40,
      "body_start": 6026,
      "body_end": 6029,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.tiktok.com/?refer=embed"
      ],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-793469-b00041",
      "text": "> ♬ –",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 41,
      "body_start": 6031,
      "body_end": 6036,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.tiktok.com/?refer=embed"
      ],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-793469-b00042",
      "text": "> If they had filmed the Barbie Movie in my neighborhood 😂",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 42,
      "body_start": 6038,
      "body_end": 6096,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-793469-b00043",
      "text": "You might be interested: Barbie in the Balkans: From disinformation to Yugonostalgia",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 43,
      "body_start": 6098,
      "body_end": 6182,
      "source_links": [
        "https://globalvoices.org/2023/07/27/barbie-in-the-balkans-from-disinformation-to-yugonostalgia/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "h4",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    }
